                            <comment id="15523307" author="sboikov" created="Mon, 26 Sep 2016 14:59:00 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Alexey,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I have some comments:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;alternate&quot; type=&quot;square&quot;&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;more simple fix is just pass &apos;internal&apos; flag to GridLoadBalancerManager&apos;s method, I believe this flag should be already available in places when GridLoadBalancerManager is called&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;also please replace in getBalancedNode: &apos;if (!spi.getName().equals(GRID_INTERNAL_LOAD_BALANCING_SPI)) -&amp;gt; (!spi instanceof RoundRobinLoadBalancingSpi&apos;), this should work faster&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;Thanks&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
